        "verbatim": "\"Establish a lightweight object detection model. To meet the speed and accuracy requirements for detecting the six common defects on the surface of PCB, this paper introduces lightweight backbone feature networks, including MobileNet series, GhostNet, and DenseNet, based on the YOLOv4 algorithm. By replacing the CSPDarkNet53 backbone feature network of YOLOv4 and conducting experiments, the YOLOv4 model based on lightweight network structures has significantly reduced volume and improved detection speed, but it has also brought about significant accuracy reduction. Among the five lightweight network models, the MobilenetV3-YOLOv4 model shows the best performance based on comprehensive evaluation indicators of average precision, harmonic mean value, model size, and FPS. Therefore, we further improve this model.\"",
