        "verbatim": "To address the issues of large parameter volumes, high computational complexity, and slow inference speed in the current algorithms applied to PCB surface defect detection, this paper replaces the CSPDarknet-53 backbone network for feature extraction in YOLOv4 with a lightweight MobileNetV3 network model. By using depthwise separable convolutions and reducing network depth, MobileNetV3 reduces parameter volumes while maintaining feature extraction capabilities and improving detection speed. This enables its application in actual industrial environments and promotes the automation and industrialization development of PCB surface defect detection.",
